&"1_1": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Hehe, that loyal servant of hers has been fussing over those fruits for a while, running all around the mansion. Mortals always overthink these things.",
"offset": Vector2(500, 0),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_3",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(760.0001, 680.0001),
"speaker": "Kitsune Left"
},
&"1_10": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Before me lays dissonance.
In love, you must have been led astray.
Perhaps you should come ask again another day...",
"offset": Vector2(3580, 100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(540.00073, 520),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_2": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "This night is quite auspicious, for a fated bride and groom. If you would like to please the kami I will aid you in your pursuit.  ",
"offset": Vector2(500, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(759.9999, 720.00037),
"speaker": "Kitsune Right"
},
&"1_3": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "I thought it quite obvious what the kami desired. Perhaps I'll give you a hint.",
"offset": Vector2(1380, 0),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_4",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(660.0001, 640.0001),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_4": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Crisp as the morning air, skin polished like laquered wool, sweet yet tart to the taste.",
"offset": Vector2(2220, 0),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(620.00024, 640.0001),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_5": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "The kami is quite partial to the harvest of the season.  Summer is soon to set and its flesh will be perfectly ripe. ",
"offset": Vector2(1420, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": &"1_6",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(760.0001, 720.0006),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_6": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Soft and sweet, with a velvet coat. ",
"offset": Vector2(2280, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(639.9988, 700.00037),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_7": {
"audio_clip": null,
"dialogue": "Tart and hard... yes, much like love itself.
In this offering, you have reached harmony.
I shall bear witness to your sacred matrimony.",
"offset": Vector2(3580, -480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": {},
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(560.00073, 520),
